OL,3,GNEWSARamsey mural aims to 'elevate'
OL,4,Afamous Manx poet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural in the north of the Isle of
OL,7,FMan aims to "celebrate and elevate" a
OL,8,Ffamous Manx poet, the artist behind the
OL,9,Fproject has said.
OL,11,FLocated in Parliament Street, Ramsey,
OL,12,Fthe five-metre (16ft) high mural
OL,13,Fdepicts Josephine Kermode, who
OL,14,Fpublished her poems, plays and stories
OL,15,Funder the name Cushag 100 years ago.
OL,17,FBorn in 1852, just two doors down from
OL,18,Fwhere the mural has been created,
OL,19,FKermode's poems and plays continue to
OL,20,Fbe performed on the island.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
