OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARamsey mural aims to 'elevate'
OL,4,Afamous Manx poet
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllustrator Jo Davies said: "It was
OL,7,Fimportant for me to make an artwork
OL,8,Fthat wasn't just a picture to decorate
OL,9,Fa wall but to celebrate, and literally
OL,10,Felevate a Ramsey-born woman who made an
OL,11,Fimportant contribution to Manx
OL,12,Fculture."
